English
=======

agent.cordis.yml is adapted from the DeepSeek Harness built-in `standard` agent
preset (MIT). On top of its native tool presentation it adds the `code_flash`
subagent (@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent), which follows the session's
`subagent-model-selection` sub-model (no hardcoded route), with a restricted
native implementation tool catalog.

See the upstream DeepSeek Harness repository for the original copyright and MIT
license notices.

中文
====

agent.cordis.yml 改编自 DeepSeek Harness 内置的 `standard` agent preset（MIT），
在其原生工具呈现之上新增 `code_flash` 子代理（@deepseek-ai/dsh-tool-subagent），
跟随会话 `subagent-model-selection` 的子模型选择（不硬编码路由），并限制原生实现
工具目录。

